#: src/Domain/Sponsorship/SponsorshipModule.php:120
msgid "One-liner shown on the plan card (what the tier includes)."
msgstr "展示在档位卡片上的一句话说明（包含什么权益）。"

#: src/Api/Rest/SponsorshipController.php:210
msgid "The return URL is not a valid absolute http(s) address."
msgstr "回跳地址不是有效的绝对 http(s) 地址。"

msgid "Erase data on scripted uninstalls"
msgstr "脚本卸载时清除数据"

msgid "Wipe the tables, settings and meta on WP-CLI and scripted uninstalls (the Plugins screen always asks)"
msgstr "WP-CLI 与脚本卸载时同时删除数据表、设置与元数据（后台插件页删除时始终会先询问）"

msgid "Deleting the plugin keeps all of its data (tables, settings, meta fields, scheduled events), so reinstalling picks up where it left off. Deleting from the Plugins screen always stops and asks first; this switch is the standing answer for the uninstalls that have no UI, such as WP-CLI. Off they keep the data, on they wipe it — the wipe cannot be undone. AIYA_CORE_UNINSTALL_PURGE = true in wp-config.php forces the same wipe everywhere and skips the question."
msgstr "删除插件不会动它的数据（数据表、设置、元数据、定时任务），重装后自动接回原状态。在后台插件页删除时会先停下来询问；本开关是无 UI 卸载（如 WP-CLI）的既定答案：关闭时保留数据，开启时一并清除——清除不可恢复。wp-config.php 中定义 AIYA_CORE_UNINSTALL_PURGE = true 可在所有卸载路径强制清除并跳过询问。"

msgid "Delete AIYA CMS Core"
msgstr "删除 AIYA CMS Core"

msgid "WordPress is about to delete the plugin files. Before that happens, choose what to do with the data the plugin wrote."
msgstr "WordPress 即将删除插件文件。在此之前，请先确认插件写入的数据如何处理。"

msgid "Keep the data"
msgstr "保留数据"

msgid "Deletes only the plugin files. The plugin tables, aiya_core_* settings, meta fields and scheduled events survive, so reinstalling picks up where it left off — the safe answer for plugin updates."
msgstr "只删除插件文件。插件数据表、aiya_core_* 设置、元数据与定时任务全部保留，重装后自动接回原状态——插件更新场景的安全选择。"

msgid "Delete plugin only, keep the data"
msgstr "仅删除插件，保留数据"

msgid "Erase everything"
msgstr "全部清除"

msgid "Also drops the plugin tables (favorites, follows, auth tokens, notifications, credits, memberships, redeem codes, payment orders, stats, discussions) plus the aiya_core_* options, meta residue, transients and scheduled events. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "同时删除插件数据表（收藏、关注、认证令牌、通知、积分、会员、兑换码、支付流水、运营统计、社区）以及 aiya_core_* 设置、元数据残留、瞬时数据与定时任务。此操作不可恢复。"

msgid "Delete plugin and erase all data"
msgstr "删除插件并清除全部数据"

msgid "Kept either way:"
msgstr "两种选择均保留："

msgid "uploaded media and the wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ tree (generated covers and avatars), and the pic-bed pool."
msgstr "上传的媒体文件与 wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ 目录（生成的封面与头像），以及图床文件池。"

msgid "Cancel, back to the plugin list"
msgstr "取消，返回插件列表"

